- In every case, these via-DEN itineraries are far more expensive than the direct HGH → SFO options and do not beat the direct price.

Conclusion
- The cheapest direct HGH → SFO economy fare around your window is about $441 (best around Nov 25).
- Transferring via DEN does not appear cheaper based on the available data; the cheapest DEN route shown is well above $1,000 and far above the direct option.

